note as BIZ_diagram_19_community
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  A delivery-platform-style discovery and reputation layer for practitioners,
  practices, hospitals, diagnostic units, pharmacies, clinics and care sites.
  Insurers and brokers may have public information profiles only when product
  policy enables them. Public content is isolated
  from the clinical record. Reviews can be encounter-verified without making
  encounter identifiers public.
end note

